# Docker build context exclusions of build/docker/Dockerfile — they speed up COPY . . and keep build
# outputs of the host machine out of the image. BuildKit reads <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to
# the Dockerfile; the context stays the repository root, so the patterns are relative to it.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.git/
.git/
.github/
artifacts/
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
docs/
